You are building the GenValue Academy website.

## Stack
- Next.js 15 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion
- Tailwind v4 uses @theme in globals.css - NO tailwind.config.ts file exists
- Brand colors are defined as CSS variables in globals.css

## Brand Colors
- Primary/Navy: #0D1B2A
- Accent Blue: #2563EB
- Emerald: #10B981
- Gold: #F59E0B
- Background: #04050A

## Rules
- Always use TypeScript. Never use `any` - use proper interfaces from src/data/course.ts
- Always use functional components with named exports
- Always add aria-labels to interactive elements
- Always handle loading and error states
- Always add dark mode variants for custom colors
- Use Framer Motion for all animations - respect prefers-reduced-motion
- Use next/image for all images with proper width, height, and alt
- Import site constants from src/lib/constants.ts
- Import course data from src/data/course.ts

## Brand
- Academy: GenValue Academy
- Instructor: Sathvik Putta
- Contact: genvalue.academy@gmail.com
- Tagline: "Choosing the Right AI Tool for Every Task"
